 ## Background
-The concept originates from methods that employ iterative refinement or dynamic network growth for radiance field optimization. The coarse-fine joint loss was introduced in Denoise-GS for self-supervised denoising in sparse-view 3D Gaussian Splatting [S2]. The multi-stage joint loss was proposed in Recursive-NeRF for efficient, dynamically growing neural radiance fields [S1].
+The concept originates from methods that employ iterative refinement or dynamic network growth for radiance field optimization [S1, S2]. The coarse-fine joint loss was introduced in Denoise-GS for self-supervised denoising in sparse-view 3D Gaussian Splatting [S2]. The multi-stage joint loss was proposed in Recursive-NeRF for efficient, dynamically growing neural radiance fields [S1].
 
